rrect!", "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}], "allowed_attempts": 2, "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "Whoops! Something important is missing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time...", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}], "id": 10, "type": "RSLT"}, {"questions": [{"_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"content": "engenn8le03ob06re7pdf01.pdf", "type": "pdf"}]}], "responses": [{"correct": 1, "selected": 0, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "id": 0}], "id": 0}], "template_override": 1, "stimuli_ids": [], "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": "Role-play a police investigation.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Take Away", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"correct_feedback": "Correct!", "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}], "allowed_attempts": 2, "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "Whoops! Something important is missing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time...", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}, {"type": "learning_skills", "contents": [{"content": "Reading", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Writing", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Speaking", "type": "skill"}]}, {"type": "post_instructions", "contents": [{"content": "Instructions: Complete the following steps. Fill in the Self Assessment.", "type": "text"}]}], "id": 11, "type": "DWS"}], "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"content": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "has_exercise_controls"}]}], "type": "scholar", "id": 0, "stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "contents": [{}], "id": 0, "type": "welcome"}, {"template_override": 1, "title": "", "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"coverimg": "engenn8le03ob06re2img01.jpg", "audiosrc": "engenn8le03ob06re2aud01", "images": [{"time": "0", "image": "engenn8le03ob06re2img01.jpg", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"time": "100", "image": "engenn8le03ob06re2img01.jpg", "id": 1, "text": "The Trial Swap<br /><br />\nThe story of Roy Rivers and Anthony Jackson illustrates the expression \"justice works in mysterious ways.\"<br />\nBoth young men were arrested on the same day and brought to a Texas prison. They met while they were waiting together in the holding cell on their way to their own separate trials at the county court house. Roy, who had been arrested on serious drug charges, mistakenly thought that Anthony was supposed to be in court for a petty crime."}, {"time": "28000", "image": "engenn8le03ob06re2img01.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "Anthony, on the other hand, thought that Roy was supposed to be on trial for credit card fraud, a less serious crime than his own.<br />\nEach was thinking that the other was in less trouble than himself and decided to switch places for their court appearances.<br />"}, {"time": "42500", "image": "engenn8le03ob06re2img01.jpg", "id": 3, "text": "While Roy was being called by the judge, Anthony took his place. Nobody noticed the swap, but Anthony was shocked to discover that Roy wasn't a small-time drug seller but one of the biggest drug smugglers in the country. He was immediately taken to a maximum security prison and was supposed to face up to 15 years in prison."}, {"time": "62100", "image": "engenn8le03ob06re2img01.jpg", "id": 4, "text": "Meanwhile, Roy, who had been sure that he would be back at home within a short time, discovered that Anthony had been arrested for murder and was wanted in over 10 states. Both men spent the rest of their lives figuring out how they had been tricked."}]}}], "_data": [], "id": 1, "type": "audio"}]}], "type": "sena"}